# The paper is built by GNU make inside WSL, reading this working copy
# directly from the Windows filesystem. A Makefile checked out with CRLF line
# endings breaks make, and the failure looks like a missing separator rather
# than like a line ending problem, so it is pinned to LF here.
#
# This repository is edited on Windows and built on Linux at the same time,
# which is exactly the case line ending conversion handles badly.
Makefile text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
